    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Egnima</i> is a solo puzzle game where the player takes control of two interdependent cubes. Each must be used strategically to progress and solve ingenious puzzles. The adventure unfolds in a semi-open world, blending exploration with linear progression, where every challenge demands deep thinking and precise coordination between the two cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will take you through a variety of biomes, each introducing unique mechanics and brand-new challenges. You'll have to face blinding snowstorms, slippery ice surfaces that limit your control, and many other obstacles that will put your problem-solving and adaptability to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to master these hostile environments and overcome every puzzle to uncover all the secrets of <i>Enigma</i>?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Egnima</i> is a solo puzzle game where the player takes control of two interdependent cubes. Each must be used strategically to progress and solve ingenious puzzles. The adventure unfolds in a semi-open world, blending exploration with linear progression, where every challenge demands deep thinking and precise coordination between the two cubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will take you through a variety of biomes, each introducing unique mechanics and brand-new challenges. You'll have to face blinding snowstorms, slippery ice surfaces that limit your control, and many other obstacles that will put your problem-solving and adaptability to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to master these hostile environments and overcome every puzzle to uncover all the secrets of <i>Enigma</i>?</p>",
    "short_description": "Egnima is a solo puzzle game where you explore diverse biomes and their unique challenges.",
